# Why do people like to record important things with photos?
I think people like to record important moments with photos because photos help preserve memories. When people look at old pictures, they can relive special experiences and emotions from the past. In addition, photos are a convenient way to share memorable moments with friends and family, especially through social media nowadays. Some photos also have sentimental value because they remind people of important milestones, such as birthdays, graduations, or trips. Overall, photos allow people to capture meaningful moments and keep them for a long time.
